WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.487
Your app works.

2
00:00:01.487 --> 00:00:04.316
Now you need Google Play and the App Store.

3
00:00:04.316 --> 00:00:09.316
By the end, you have a plan for both stores, draft answers, and screenshots.

4
00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:13.000
And one rule on Google Play, that catches most founders.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.205
Step one.

6
00:00:15.205 --> 00:00:16.214
Make your plan.

7
00:00:16.214 --> 00:00:17.828
Type shipvo store setup.

8
00:00:17.828 --> 00:00:20.586
It asks if you have a registered company.

9
00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:26.034
With a company, you get organization accounts, and no tester rule on Google Play.

10
00:00:26.034 --> 00:00:30.675
Without one, you get a personal account, and the tester rule applies.

11
00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:32.883
Step two.

12
00:00:32.883 --> 00:00:34.571
Type shipvo store status.

13
00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:37.002
You see one timeline for each store.

14
00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:39.568
Every step is to do, waiting, or done.

15
00:00:39.568 --> 00:00:41.526
It tells you what to do next.

16
00:00:41.526 --> 00:00:44.025
When you finish a step, mark it done.

17
00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:47.009
Step three.

18
00:00:47.009 --> 00:00:49.877
The stores ask what data your app collects.

19
00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:52.878
Type shipvo store details --dry-run.

20
00:00:52.878 --> 00:00:59.348
Shipvo reads the features your app uses, and drafts the data safety answers and a privacy policy.

21
00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:04.750
Some questions only you can answer, like third-party tools and a contact address.

22
00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:07.026
Step four.

23
00:01:07.026 --> 00:01:07.837
Screenshots.

24
00:01:07.837 --> 00:01:09.866
Type shipvo store screenshots.

25
00:01:09.866 --> 00:01:15.815
Shipvo shows your app in the simulator, and saves files in the sizes the stores ask for.

26
00:01:15.815 --> 00:01:17.100
It checks each one.

27
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.266
Now, the rule.

28
00:01:21.266 --> 00:01:27.220
On Google Play with a personal account, you need twelve testers for fourteen days in a row.

29
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.837
Type shipvo store testers for the steps.

30
00:01:29.837 --> 00:01:34.089
Shipvo Testers is a group of founders who test each other's apps.

31
00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:35.725
We have a video about it.

32
00:01:37.325 --> 00:01:39.040
So here is what you have.

33
00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:41.236
A plan for each store, in order.

34
00:01:41.236 --> 00:01:44.529
Data safety answers, and a privacy policy draft.

35
00:01:44.529 --> 00:01:47.343
Screenshots in every store size, checked.

36
00:01:47.343 --> 00:01:48.784
And the tester steps.

37
00:01:48.784 --> 00:01:49.950
You press submit.

38
00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:52.973
Start with your plan.

39
00:01:52.973 --> 00:01:55.886
Type shipvo store setup in your app folder.

40
00:01:55.886 --> 00:01:57.919
Next, get your twelve testers.

41
00:01:57.919 --> 00:02:00.900
The guide is at shipvo.dev/learn.
